<!-- ===== LAB MINI ===== -->
<section class="tab" id="lab">
  <h2>🧪 Lab Mini – Uji Sendiri</h2>
  <div class="card">
    <p><b>Prediksi dulu:</b> berapa gaya tarik yang dibutuhkan? Baru geser slider untuk membuktikan.</p>
    <div class="row">
      <div class="sub" id="labType" style="margin:0"></div>
      <label>Berat beban w (N): <input type="number" id="labW" value="600" min="10" max="5000" step="10" style="width:7rem"></label>
      <label>Jari-jari katrol r (cm): <input type="number" id="labR" value="10" min="2" max="50" style="width:6rem"></label>
    </div>
    <div class="grid g2">
      <div class="center"><div id="labSvg"></div><div id="labLeg" style="text-align:left;font-size:.8rem;margin-top:.5rem"></div></div>
      <div>
        <label><b>Tarik tali sejauh:</b> <span id="labDv">0</span> cm</label>
        <input type="range" id="labD" min="0" max="60" value="0">
        <div class="ro">
          <div>Lengan beban (Lb)<b id="rLb">-</b></div>
          <div>Lengan kuasa (Lk)<b id="rLk">-</b></div>
          <div>w × Lb<b id="rTb">-</b></div>
          <div>F × Lk<b id="rTk">-</b></div>
          <div>Gaya tarik F<b id="rF">-</b></div>
          <div>Panjang tali ditarik (s)<b id="rS">-</b></div>
          <div>Tinggi beban naik (h)<b id="rH">-</b></div>
          <div>KM = Lk/Lb = s/h<b id="rKM">-</b></div>
          <div>Usaha F × s<b id="rWk">-</b></div>
          <div>Usaha w × h<b id="rWb">-</b></div>
        </div>
        <div class="think" style="margin-top:.7rem">💭 Bandingkan (1) "w × Lb" dengan "F × Lk", dan (2) "Usaha F × s" dengan "Usaha w × h". Apa yang kamu temukan?</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="card">
    <h3>🧮 Kalkulator Katrol Gabungan</h3>
    <div class="row">
      <label>Beban w (N): <input type="number" id="kW" value="800" style="width:7rem"></label>
      <label>Beban naik h (m): <input type="number" id="kH" value="2" step="0.5" style="width:6rem"></label>
      <label>Tali penopang n: <select id="kN"><option>1</option><option selected>2</option><option>3</option><option>4</option><option>5</option><option>6</option></select></label>
      <button class="btn" onclick="hitung()">Hitung</button>
